          "node": {
            "body": "\u003cp\u003eI use Claude Code every day, often while I'm in the browser checking Search Console or a store page, so ⌘E-to-task is exactly the jump I make by hand now: copy the URL, switch to the terminal, explain the context. Is a Windows version on the roadmap? I'm on Windows 11 and would try it the day it ships.\u003c/p\u003e",
