          "node": {
            "body": "\u003cp\u003eThe idea of turning a random thought while browsing into actual work without breaking your focus feels genuinely useful.Congrats \u003ca href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/@williamgaoharvard\" data-node-type=\"mention\" data-mention-type=\"user\" data-mention-id=\"williamgaoharvard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"\u003e@williamgaoharvard\u003c/a\u003e \u003c/p\u003e",
            "createdAt": "2026-10-06T16:38:46Z",
            "id": "5925509",
            "parentId": null,
            "replies": {
              "edges": [
                {
                  "node": {
                    "body": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/@angelo_bram\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"\u003e@angelo_bram\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;Thank you! So much innovation and productivity can come when we treat our random thoughts seriously\u003c/p\u003e",
