        {
          "node": {
            "body": "\u003cp\u003ethe per-turn snapshot and Undo you mentioned in another thread is the detail that got me, I've been asking a version of this question on a few launches lately - does that snapshot/undo only cover the git state, or does it also know about anything the agent did outside the repo during that turn (an API call it made, a form it submitted on the page it was reading)? code is easy to revert, a request that already fired isn't, and that gap is the part I haven't seen anyone solve yet\u003c/p\u003e",
            "createdAt": "2026-10-06T14:55:59Z",
            "id": "5925223",
            "parentId": null,
            "replies": {
              "edges": [
                {
                  "node": {
                    "body": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/@galdayan\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"\u003e@galdayan\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;it knows everything the agent knows through that turn. due to practical reason we can't save every turn that ever happened, but all recent turns will have a good snapshot\u003c/p\u003e",
                    "createdAt": "2026-10-06T22:04:50Z",
                    "id": "5926231",
                    "parentId": "5925223",
                    "url": "https://www.producthunt.com/products/rill-3?comment=5926231\u0026utm_campaign=producthunt-api\u0026utm_medium=api-v2\u0026utm_source=Application%3A+sokel+%28ID%3A+304976%29",
                    "user": {
                      "isViewer": false,
                      "username": "[REDACTED]"
                    },
                    "votesCount": 1
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": "https://www.producthunt.com/products/rill-3?comment=5925223\u0026utm_campaign=producthunt-api\u0026utm_medium=api-v2\u0026utm_source=Application%3A+sokel+%28ID%3A+304976%29",
            "user": {
              "isViewer": false,
