            },
            "votesCount": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "node": {
            "body": "\u003cp\u003eCongrats on the launch, William! The code-switching problem is real. Ideas tend to hit when I'm reading something unrelated, and having ⌘E turn the page into a task for the agent in the right project sounds like a great way to catch them. Looking forward to trying it out.\u003c/p\u003e",
            "createdAt": "2026-10-06T13:23:59Z",
            "id": "5924996",
            "parentId": null,
            "replies": {
              "edges": [
                {
                  "node": {
                    "body": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/@adityaharish2002\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"\u003e@adityaharish2002\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;Thank you! Please do give it a try and share any feedback you have\u003c/p\u003e",
                    "createdAt": "2026-10-06T22:09:57Z",
                    "id": "5926237",
                    "parentId": "5924996",
                    "url": "https://www.producthunt.com/products/rill-3?comment=5926237\u0026utm_campaign=producthunt-api\u0026utm_medium=api-v2\u0026utm_source=Application%3A+sokel+%28ID%3A+304976%29",
