        {
          "node": {
            "body": "\u003cp\u003esending an idea straight from the page makes sense. does the task keep a snapshot of that page, so the agent still has the original context if i navigate away or the site changes?\u003c/p\u003e",
            "createdAt": "2026-10-06T13:09:30Z",
            "id": "5924962",
            "parentId": null,
            "replies": {
              "edges": [
                {
                  "node": {
                    "body": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/@jeetendra_kumar2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"\u003e@jeetendra_kumar2\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;The agent has original context. So once you sent your ask, you can keep browsing as you always do - jump through tabs, close tabs, etc\u003c/p\u003e",
                    "createdAt": "2026-10-06T22:05:36Z",
                    "id": "5926233",
                    "parentId": "5924962",
                    "url": "https://www.producthunt.com/products/rill-3?comment=5926233\u0026utm_campaign=producthunt-api\u0026utm_medium=api-v2\u0026utm_source=Application%3A+sokel+%28ID%3A+304976%29",
