        {
          "node": {
            "body": "\u003cp\u003eTurning the page you are already looking at into a task for your agent with one shortcut is a really natural way to blend browsing and building. Passing along the right project context is the part that usually goes wrong in these setups, so handling that automatically is nice. Does the agent stay in the background while you keep browsing other tabs?\u003c/p\u003e",
            "createdAt": "2026-10-06T12:02:36Z",
            "id": "5924773",
            "parentId": null,
            "replies": {
              "edges": [
                {
                  "node": {
                    "body": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/@karimbenkeroum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"\u003e@karimbenkeroum\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;Yes. The key idea is that you send the request the moment you got an idea, and once you sent the request you don't need to do anything else. You can browse this tab, other tabs, close any tabs, or even close Rill and come back later. Agents will continue working on the background \u003c/p\u003e",
                    "createdAt": "2026-10-06T22:09:26Z",
                    "id": "5926236",
                    "parentId": "5924773",
                    "url": "https://www.producthunt.com/products/rill-3?comment=5926236\u0026utm_campaign=producthunt-api\u0026utm_medium=api-v2\u0026utm_source=Application%3A+sokel+%28ID%3A+304976%29",
